# A second `Model:` + fields meets the binding Model the first declared: by general resolution (book §9 :559; the
# author, Q54: a closer such as `end: Model` declares nothing) it is the assignment to Model, refused as one -- a
# named Structure is no assignable typed value.  (Before OPUS-Q54-TRAILER-20260929-13 the `end:`-closed "definition
# shape", FABLE-SONNET-EMPTY-STRUCT-20260923-132 (b), refused it as "duplicate named Structure".)
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

Model:
    size_t: other 2U
end: Model

return: 0
